{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶節目帶來連場勁歌熱舞，原本由一眾實力唱將擔大旗的環節，竟然被同台伴舞的兒童舞者完全搶走焦點。這班小舞者 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫台慶節目帶來連場勁歌熱舞，原本由一眾實力唱將擔大旗的環節，竟然被同台伴舞的兒童舞者完全搶走焦點。這班小舞者憑藉超投入演出與精湛舞技震撼全場，就連專業歌手面對他們超強實力亦大受打擊。這群神秘小舞者的驚人背景終於被全面揭開。</p>\n<h2>萬千星輝賀台慶舞台兒童舞者成全晚焦點</h2>\n<p>在盛況空前的台慶舞台上，中年跳唱環節掀起全晚高潮，一眾歌手落力演出經典金曲。然而全場目光卻被一班同台伴舞的兒童舞者深深吸引，他們在偌大舞台上面對全港觀眾毫不怯場，展現出極高水準的舞台爆發力。這群小朋友每一個舞步都精準有力，憑藉超投入演出與精湛舞技光芒四射，成功在眾多實力派前輩面前突圍而出，展現出毫不遜色於專業表演者的氣場與魅力。</p>\n<h2>鄭家聲唱跳《狂野之城》慘受打擊</h2>\n<p>本身是跳唱擔當的鄭家聲在節目綵排期間，已經被這班小舞者深深震懾。他在經典金曲《狂野之城》表演中需要加入高難度韓團舞步，面對極大挑戰時不禁笑言「太睇得起我、高估了我」。他對現場小朋友表現讚不絕口，坦言看到他們第一次表演時僅僅用了七成功力，其功架已經令他當場「O嘴」佩服。同場歌手譚輝智見狀亦大感羨慕，直言有意請鄭家聲出山教愛女跳舞。</p>\n<h2>韓國偶像學院猛料背景師承天團導師</h2>\n<p>這班成功搶鏡的小舞者實力非凡，全數來自大有來頭並被譽為演藝新生代搖籃YS韓國偶像學院。該學院提供唱歌跳舞及模特兒等廣泛培訓，師資陣容堪稱天花板級別，全為當時得令包括國際天團Blackpink等御用導師。學院在彈性及度身訂造課程下讓學員學習事半功倍，加上社長Yong Heo掌握強大人脈經常為學員爭取試鏡機會，令這批實力出眾小學員早已成為娛樂公司虎視眈眈目標。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚超強實力獲封環節絕對MVP</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發大批觀眾熱烈討論，一眾小舞者火速被網民全面「起底」。許多觀眾對於兒童舞者展現出的專業水準感到無比震驚，紛紛在網上留言大讚他們表現出眾，以超乎年齡的穩定性與舞台魅力征服大眾。這群小朋友在網上討論區獲得一致好評，光芒四射的演出被大批網民及觀眾留言激讚為該環節中無可取代「絕對MVP」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951613623117737_2135180956afffd12c8a70.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716311.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951613623117737_2135180956afffd12c8a70.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>萬千星輝賀台慶舞台兒童舞者成全晚焦點（圖片來源：IG@ysgroupkr）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136326024995_6800488956afffd13d76a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716314.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136326024995_6800488956afffd13d76a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>韓國偶像學院猛料背景師承天團導師（圖片來源：IG@ysgroupkr）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136414488301_15921506526afffd1486893.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716312.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136414488301_15921506526afffd1486893.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ysgroupkr）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136496932149_16524568236afffd1562d86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716313.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136496932149_16524568236afffd1562d86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ysgroupkr）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136613886997_10414954106afffd167f1e2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6339315817471743376.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516136613886997_10414954106afffd167f1e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>《中年好聲音》環節 小朋友Dancer勁搶鏡，是MVP（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%85%92%e7%ab%a5%e8%88%9e%e8%80%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">兒童舞者</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ad%e5%ae%b6%e8%81%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭家聲</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546750\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.357310+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1368,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:56:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:21.181126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:21.181126+00:00","content_hash":"6f04b52c24baed22c4a678d2403dfb07a44ee2be0deac740f59883a782c64450","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}